  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING COMMUNITY CONSERVATION IN UGANDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the border areas of national parks in Uganda, wildlife and people compete over land and natural resources. 50% of wildlife live on people&apos;s land. Umoja strengthens the capacity of communities to deal with human-wildlife conflicts, establish conservancies and protect, manage and benefit from wildlife, by training scouts on anti-poaching and human-wildlife conflict mitigation measures, increasing public awareness on conservation benefits and improving governance structures of conservancies.</narrative>
  </description>
